vantage. Report honestly as underpowered (n≤6)\"\n   - Depends on: [plan_004, plan_008]\n   - GPU hours est: 0\n   - Claims: [\"Claim 4\"]\n\n### Running Experiments (status: \"running\"):\n\nThere are **2 currently running experiments**:\n\n1. **plan_004** - \"GPT-2 Factual Recall K=3 CSS\"\n2. **plan_008** - \"IOI size-controlled baseline\"\n\n### Additional Context:\n\nThe experiment plan also references extensive \"imagined experiments\" files in dream reports that contain detailed expected results, rationales, and narratives for both \"best tier\" and \"worst tier\" scenarios:\n\n- `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/structfuse-context/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T081242/best/imagined_experiments.yaml` (detailed best-case scenario with 14 experiments)\n- `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/structfuse-context/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T081242/worst/imagined_experiments.yaml` (detailed worst-case scenario analysis)\n\nThese imagined experiments provide detailed expected results, success criteria, analytical frameworks, and failure mode documentation for guiding actual experimental execution."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"34ed447c-bdea-491d-9484-fa0c1a53bf03","uuid":"c616c4c6-f42b-469f-ab2a-63134253d33b","timestamp":"2026-05-13T09:23:31.344Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Search the directory /home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3 for files related to experiment plans. Look for files named like \"experiment_plan*\", \"plan*\", or any YAML/markdown files that contain \"planned\" experiment definitions. Use glob patterns like **/*experiment*plan*, **/*plan*.yaml, **/*plan*.md, and grep for \"status: planned\" or \"PLANNED\". I need to find where the planned (not yet completed) experiments are defined. Report the file paths and their content.","agentId":"ae2cfb4e926a97c40","agentType":"Explore","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I now have comprehens